'''Hidden Jerries''' are mobs that have a chance of appearing when a [[player]] earns [[Skills|Skill XP]] through killing mobs, mining, farming, or foraging while {{NPCSprite|Candidate Jerry;Jerry}} is elected as mayor.

== Spawning ==
'''Hidden Jerry''' can spawn while {{NPCSprite|Mayor Jerry}} is in office and player gains Skill XP. Chance to spawn depends on the activity:

