== Behavior ==
When a '''Hidden Jerry''' is found a message will appear in your chat letting you know that a Jerry has spawned. There will be a floating head that will fly around for about 3 seconds before spawning a '''Hidden Jerry'''. Once spawned, the Jerry will quickly run away, sometimes falling into the void or off a high area. Using a bow from a distance can however be used to shoot the Jerry without it running away.

Being {{mt|shielded}}, '''Hidden Jerries''' can only take {{stat|dmg|1}} per hit. They can be damaged by melee attacks and [[bows]], but not [[Mage]] weapons. All have the possibility to be runic. When killed, they drop a [[Jerry Box]] that corresponds to the color (for example, Golden Jerry drops the {{Gold|Golden}} [[Jerry Box]]). The summoner has a drop priority for 25 seconds{{confirm}}, after which anyone who kills '''Hidden Jerry''' will obtain the box. 

